,"justification":"2963"},"removeUnusedVar",{"varName":"2969"},{"range":"2970","text":"2930"},"Remove unused variable \"organizationEventRequestSchema\".","directive","confirmation coordinates token scope, identity update, audit, and notifications.","coordinates capture, suppression, route reservation, and provider acceptance.","validates the bounded Cloudflare envelope and normalizes provider-specific fields.","paginates the bounded Organization route backfill and preserves its cursor.","coordinates sandbox gates, suppression, route reservation, and provider acceptance.","coordinates the fake and Stripe Connect checkout paths.","this coordinates fake and Stripe Connect checkout paths.","dispatches the bounded internal mutation union without changing its routing semantics.","source-specific reset logic is kept atomic with the ledger reset.","","coordinates reservation, signed receipt, and Stripe checkout.","this store dispatches the bounded poll management union.","coordinates idempotent multi-profile dues checkout state.","validates and records one atomic multi-profile dues attempt.","dispatches the typed Organization season/payment operations.","validates one performance or bundle and its capacity.","atomically reserves capacity, redemption, payment, and audit rows.","enforces target, uniqueness, immutability, persistence, and audit rules.","evaluates item availability and redeemable-code limits.","maps the immutable checkout snapshot to public/admin DTOs.","dispatches the typed ticket/payment operations.","validates connected-account, metadata, and event identity.","reports independent readiness states for the provider lanes.","this route sequences suppression, settings, rate-limit, and creation safeguards.","this endpoint preserves typed payment-activation failure states.","this endpoint maps provider status and typed failure states.","this endpoint preserves onboarding authorization and provider failures.","this bounded workflow coordinates auth, source reset, queueing, and audit state.","this monitoring endpoint reports each independent readiness dimension.","the shared dialog owns optional preview and confirmation states.","Safari still requires returnValue for the native prompt.","this is the standalone practice player and its controls.","this editor coordinates upload, camera, preview, and removal states.","camera startup handles permission, device discovery, and stream cleanup.","the editor coordinates Profile fields and the verified email-change request state.","add/edit source validation and cleanup are intentionally co-located.","this editor coordinates sections, part assignments, and reassignment dialogs.","the RSVP manager coordinates filters, per-row updates, and bulk selection in one screen state.","mark the selected roster as loading before the request starts.","synchronize the saved event after events load.","this page coordinates loading, editing, and deletion dialogs.","the shell coordinates pinned and modal navigation states.","render composition preserves the existing screen's independent states and dialogs.","the editor keeps the event form's cross-field controls together.","the main events manager screen coordinates multiple modals, bulk actions, and filters.","saveEvent handles graphic upload/cleanup, updates vs creation, and returnTo navigation.","profile save coordinates linked membership and roster updates.","item editor dialog handles multiple linked/unlinked piece properties and soloist assignments.","organizationEventRequestSchema",[146,180]]